  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dfe88ea1446f639428eb628f6eae278e, type: 3}
  m_Name: InfoPoint2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueAsset
  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: Something we can do is to act more sustainably. This means things like
      recycling, or reusing things we might consider trash.
  - speaker: 
    text: We can reuse parts, and give them new life. Old equipment doesn't have
      to become waste. This can be as simple as reusing water bottles.
  - speaker: 
    text: Next time you think about throwing something out, ask yourself if there's
      another way it can be used.
